## REST API

| Method | Endpoint | Body |
|--------|----------|------|
| `POST` | `/api/v1/auth/phone/send-code` | `{"phone": "+77001234567"}` |
| `POST` | `/api/v1/auth/phone/verify` | `{"phone": "+77001234567", "code": "123456"}` |
| `POST` | `/api/v1/auth/google` | `{"id_token": "..."}` |
| `POST` | `/api/v1/auth/apple` | `{"id_token": "..."}` |
| `POST` | `/api/v1/auth/refresh` | `{"refresh_token": "..."}` |
| `POST` | `/api/v1/auth/logout` | `{"access_token": "...", "refresh_token": "..."}` |
| `GET` | `/health` | — |
| `GET` | `/ready` | — |

